                <pb facs="0951" n="845" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg845"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Brown to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-07-18"><hi rendition="#italic">July, 18,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Brown reports that the consul at Tegucigalpa telegraphs that Honduras
                    desires peace and will not trouble Guatemala.</p>
                <p>A telegram in harmony with the instructions of the department has been sent
                    him.)</p>
            </div>
